   354	Two behavioral changes are visible. A host missing a required toolchain now
   355	fails before external acquisition rather than after audit, so a previously
   356	network-and-disk-expensive failure becomes cheap and its diagnostic changes
   357	from a compiler or driver error to a typed `build_toolchain_*` code. And
